#. +> trunk
#: plugin_wallpaper.cpp:195
msgid ""
"<p>You selected a remote image. It needs to be saved to your local disk to be used as a wallpaper.</p>"
"<p>You will now be asked where to save the image.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du hest en feern Bild utsöcht. Wenn Du dat as Achtergrundbild bruken wullt, muttst Du dat na Dien Fastplaat sekern.</p>"
"<p>Du warrst nu fraagt, woneem Du dat Bild sekern wullt.</p>"

